1. Food Delivery System

Class Customer:
    Attributes:
        name
        address

Class Restaurant:
    Attributes:
        name
        location

Class DeliveryBoy:
    Attributes:
        name
        phoneNumber

Class Order:
    Attributes:
        customer : Customer
        restaurant : Restaurant
        deliveryBoy : DeliveryBoy
        items : List of Strings
        totalAmount

    Constructor(customer, restaurant, deliveryBoy, items, totalAmount):
        Set all attributes

    Method displayOrderDetails():
        Print customer.name and address
        Print restaurant.name and location
        Print deliveryBoy.name and phoneNumber
        Print items and totalAmount

2. Medical Record Manager

Interface Searchable:
    Method search(keyword)

Interface Printable:
    Method print()

Abstract Class MedicalReport implements Searchable, Printable:
    Attributes:
        reportId
        patientName
        date

    Abstract Method search(keyword)
    Abstract Method print()

Class LabReport inherits MedicalReport:
    Attributes:
        testResults

    Method search(keyword):
        If keyword in testResults:
            Return true
        Else:
            Return false

    Method print():
        Print reportId, patientName, testResults

Class Prescription inherits MedicalReport:
    Attributes:
        medicines

    Method search(keyword):
        If keyword in medicines:
            Return true
        Else:
            Return false

    Method print():
        Print reportId, patientName, medicines
